    "notes": "The northern Yad Vashem range follows its bent PMTiles footprint. The western seminar glazing bands, recessed limestone library windows, school piers and glazed stair towers remain distinct across the joined volumes. The assignment of exterior bays uses relative position in the overhead and exterior photographs. Roof heights, opening counts, roof equipment and the uphill facade remain approximate. This model covers the connected range. The detached study wing still needs its own exterior model."
  },
